%\frac{ \alpha_hw A_h p^{\alpha} S^{\alpha_h-\alpha}\theta_c^{1-\alpha}}{\alpha\big(A_c+a(bS^{\sigma}\theta_n^{\sigma}-\bar{x})\big)}\\
