  This equivalence follows from a general property of quantile functions: for any distribution function $G$ and its associated quantile function $Q$, we have $Q(\alpha)\le x$ if and only if $\alpha\le G(x)$, where $Q$ is defined as the left-continuous inverse of $G$.
