  \]
  such that $\xi(u_n)/r_n \sim u_n^\beta/r_n \to 0 $, since $u_n$ grows only logarithmically while $r_n$ grows polynomially in $n$. 
  As shown in the proof of Corollary~\ref{cor:light_det}, we have
