$\theta_{i+1}:=\angle(S_i,S_{i+1})\in(\pi,2\pi)$ since the cone formed by $S_{i}$ and $S_{i+1}$ (whose inner normals are $\nu_{S_i}$ and $\nu_{S_{i+1}}$) is concave.}
