        l_\alpha = \sigma \gamma_1 \gamma_5 ((c + w^2)x_2 + (c + w^1)x_1) = \sigma \gamma_1 \gamma_5 \alpha_{Q}
    \end{equation*}
    from \Cref{eq:case1_LinTermRed} and \Cref{eq:case1_tRed}. This proves tangency.

