For any $Y\subseteq X$ and any $0< k<|Y|$, the equivalence relation $e^\Sigma_{Y,k} \coloneqq   e^\Sigma_{Y,(k-1)_\leq}\rand e^\Sigma_{Y,k_\leq}$   defines the following tripartition  of $W$:
\[\{\{w\in W \mid w_Y \leq k-1 \}, \{w\in W \mid w_Y  = k \}, \{w\in W \mid w_Y > k \}\}.\] 
