The relation above reflects a situation in which   Alan is willing to include the question `does the car perform well on some parameter Betty considers relevant?' in the aggregated agenda, while Betty is willing to include the question `does the car perform well on none, one, or more  parameters Alan  considers relevant?' in the aggregated agenda. The operation  $\pdra$ induced by $S$ is such that

