\}$ is a convex function, by Jensen's inequality we get $\max_{j\in A}\EE[\boldsymbol{\theta}_j+\eta\epsilon_j]\leq \EE[\max_{j\in A}\{\boldsymbol{\theta}_j+\eta\epsilon_j\}].$
Then it follows that 
