\section{The Geode and the Encyclopedia}

\WR{} list around fifteen sequences derived from the hyper-Catalans that are found in the Online Encyclopedia of Integer Sequences~\cite{OEIS}.
Here we generate the analogous sequences for the Geode and find many that have yet to appear in the OEIS.

