\begin{corollary}[Brunn-Minkowski inequality]
Let $B, f$ and $F$ be as in the previous theorem. Then for all measurable subsets $A_0, A_1\subset B\times_f^\sN F$ with $\m^\sN(A_0)\m^\sN(A_1)>0$ it holds that 
$$\m(A_t)^\frac{1}{N}\geq \tau_{KN,N+1}^{(1-t)}(\Theta) \m(A_0)^\frac{1}{N} + \tau_{KN,N+1}^{(t)}(\Theta) \m(A_1)^\frac{1}{N}$$
