\subsection{Semi-concave functions}
For $\kappa\in\R$ let the {\it generalized sine functions}  $\sin_\kappa: [0, \infty)\rightarrow \R$ be the solution of 
$$u''+ \kappa u=0, \ \ u(0)=0, \ u'(0)=1.$$
