\begin{corollary}
We consider $u \in \bigcup_{t>0} P_t^{\sB, \sN}C_{c}^\infty(\mathring B)+ C^\infty_{c}(\mathring B)\otimes D_{\sW^{1,2}}(L^\sF)  $.
