According to the above definitions, we can define the transition probability matrix of the LLMO $\mathbf{P}_{\sf{LLM}}\in\mathbb{R}^{|\mathbb{S}|\times|\mathbb{S}|}$ which collects the transition probabilities $p_{s\tilde{s}}\triangleq\Pr\{s^{(t)}=s|s^{(t-1)}=\tilde{s}\}$ as its $(s,\tilde{s})$-th element. It is given by
