\section{Independent sets from lattices}
\label{sec:lattice}

Towards the proof of \autoref{prop:construction-intro}, we discuss in this section the connection between subgroup independent sets in powers of fraction graphs and lattices, and we discuss a method for proving lower bounds on the minimum distance of lattices, which we will use later.

