Using a smooth-path hypothesis,  
\begin{equation}
\boldsymbol{\eta}_{\tau+1}^{\pm} \simeq \boldsymbol{\eta}^{\pm}(t)+\Delta t \,\partial_{t}\boldsymbol{\eta}^{\pm}(t),
\end{equation}
